{\b\fs36 Murabbiy ovozi: yozib olish ro'yxati}\par\par
Talaffuz murabbiyi jonli ovoz bilan gapiradi (TTS emas). Har bir gap alohida qisqa fayl: ilova ularni ketma-ket ulab, to'liq gap yasaydi. Masalan:\par
{\f1\fs22 word_rasm + coach_pos_start + letter_r + coach_instead_of + letter_l + coach_i_heard}\par
{\f1\fs22 = "rasm so\u699?zining boshida r o\u699?rniga l eshitdim."}\par
Fayl yo'q bo'lsa ilova buzilmaydi: murabbiy gapi faqat matn bo'lib ko'rinadi. Faqat {\b quloq o'yini} word_* va wrong_* yozuvlarisiz yopiq turadi.\par
Jami: {\b 410 ta fayl}. Hammasini birdan yozish shart emas \u8212? bir harfdan boshlang (masalan R): shu harfning ko'rsatmasi, tovushi, bo'g'inlari va so'zlari yetarli.\par
\par{\b\fs28 Qayerga qo'yiladi}\par
{\f1\fs22 Sources/Ovozcha/Resources/Audio/<fayl nomi>.m4a}\par
Papka yo'q bo'lsa, yarating. Qo'yilgandan keyin ilovani qayta yig'ing (skip app launch). Fayl nomi aynan jadvaldagidek bo'lishi shart (kichik harf, _).\par
\par{\b\fs28 Yozish qoidalari}\par
\bullet  Format: {\b m4a (AAC), mono}. mp3 va wav ham ishlaydi.\par
\bullet  Tinch xona, telefon og'izdan ~20 sm. Bir kishi, bir xil ohang.\par
\bullet  Boshi va oxiridagi jimlikni kesing (0.1 s dan oshmasin) \u8212? bo'laklar ulanganda gap tabiiy eshitilishi uchun.\par
\bullet  Bolaga gapirgandek: iliq, sekinroq, aniq.\par
\bullet  Bo'lak gaplarni (masalan coach_pos_start) gap o'rtasidagidek, pasaymaydigan ohangda ayting.\par
\par{\b\fs28 Qo'shimcha foyda: nutq tanish etalonlari}\par
word_* yozuvlari tekshiruv aniqligini ham oshiradi. Whisper to'g'ri aytilgan so'zni ham xato yozishi mumkin ("robot" -> "Lobots"). Buni bola xatosi deb hisoblamaslik uchun ularni Tools/reference-transcripts/audio/ ga so'zning o'zi nomi bilan nusxalang (word_robot.m4a -> robot.m4a) va Tools/reference-transcripts/build.py ni ishga tushiring.\par
\par{\b\fs28 1. Murabbiy iboralari (25 ta)}\par
1. {\b coach_praise_1} \u8212? Barakalla!\par
2. {\b coach_praise_2} \u8212? Zo\u699?r!\par
3. {\b coach_praise_3} \u8212? Juda to\u699?g\u699?ri!\par
4. {\b coach_listen_repeat} \u8212? Tingla va takrorla.\par
5. {\b coach_say_word} \u8212? Tingla, keyin o\u699?zing ayt.\par
6. {\b coach_say_aloud} \u8212? Ovoz chiqarib ayt.\par
7. {\b coach_self_listen} \u8212? Yaxshi! Endi o\u699?z ovozingni tingla.\par
8. {\b coach_which_right} \u8212? Tingla: qaysi biri to\u699?g\u699?ri?\par
9. {\b coach_first} \u8212? Birinchisi:\par
10. {\b coach_second} \u8212? Ikkinchisi:\par
11. {\b coach_listen_again} \u8212? Yana bir tinglab ko\u699?r.\par
12. {\b coach_almost} \u8212? Deyarli! Yana bir marta, sekinroq ayt.\par
13. {\b coach_try_again} \u8212? Yana bir marta aytib ko\u699?r.\par
14. {\b coach_not_heard} \u8212? Eshitmadim. Balandroq ayt.\par
15. {\b coach_move_on} \u8212? Yaxshi urinding! Xohlasang, keyingisiga o\u699?tamiz.\par
16. {\b coach_once_more} \u8212? Yana bir bor!\par
17. {\b coach_stage_done} \u8212? Barakalla! Bu bosqichni tugatding.\par
18. {\b coach_stage_partial} \u8212? Yaxshi! Yana mashq qilsak, hammasi chiqadi.\par
19. {\b coach_stage_retry} \u8212? Bosqich tugadi. Keling, yana bir bor urinib ko\u699?ramiz.\par
20. {\b coach_pos_start} \u8212? so\u699?zining boshida\par
21. {\b coach_pos_middle} \u8212? so\u699?zining o\u699?rtasida\par
22. {\b coach_pos_end} \u8212? so\u699?zining oxirida\par
23. {\b coach_instead_of} \u8212? o\u699?rniga\par
24. {\b coach_i_heard} \u8212? eshitdim.\par
25. {\b coach_sound_not_heard} \u8212? tovushini eshitmadim.\par
\par{\b\fs28 2. Tovushni qanday aytish (29 ta)}\par
Har bir dars boshida va xatodan keyin aytiladi.\par
1. {\b coach_hint_a} \u8212? Og\u699?zingni katta och: aaa.\par
2. {\b coach_hint_b} \u8212? Lablaringni yum, keyin ovoz bilan och: b-b-b.\par
3. {\b coach_hint_d} \u8212? Til uchini tishlaring orqasiga tegizib, ovoz bilan: d-d-d.\par
