5. {\b coach_hint_f} \u8212? Yuqori tishlaringni pastki labingga tegizib, pufla: fff.\par
6. {\b coach_hint_g} \u8212? Til orqasini tepaga ko\u699?tar, ovoz bilan: g-g-g.\par
